  "title": "Why Yelp Supports California’s COMPETE Act",
  "summary": "California’s startup ecosystem thrives when competition is fair. When the most dominant corporations wield their power to stifle competition, the next generation of innovators gets shut out, and Californians pay the cost, consumers lose choice, workers lose opportunity, and the next wave of great ideas never gets off the ground. Yelp knows this firsthand. For […]",
